# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# seed/qualification/om2/sec/s3s4/candidate.cases: OM-2 contract sections 3 (rotate) and 4 (unroll, inline,
# folding, check elimination, parameter slots, resource bounds, source mapping) for a CANDIDATE OM-2
# compiler (#748, L836, lane QualPhaseB.FixRotUnroll). Contract: ~/workspace/om2-contract/spec/omegese-om2.md
# (frozen, sha256 245bb74e...), errata E1-E4 on om2/contract. "§3 l.79" = section 3, contract line 79.
# Expected stdout/exit: oracle/s3s4/exp (python3 3.12.3, oracle/s3s4/oracle.py; PROVENANCE.txt there).
# Expected refusal codes and diagnostic words: the contract lines cited. Program-mode fixtures are
# compiled as FIXTURE+lib-pu.om (decimal printer, OM-1 words); selector fixtures read one stdin byte.
# Run: build/om2-qual/gate-b OMC OMC_SHA256 seed/qualification/om2/sec/s3s4/candidate.cases SCRATCH
deadline 60

# ---- §3 rotate: values (l.76-78), all widths, n = 0 1 mid w-1 constant and run-time, full run-time sweep
rot-values run seed/qualification/om2/sec/s3s4/rot-values.om+seed/qualification/om2/sec/s3s4/lib-pu.om - file:seed/qualification/om2/oracle/s3s4/exp/rot-values.out - 0
# C1 (§0 l.17) and oracle cross-check: the OM-1 shift twin computes the same lines
rot-values-om1 run seed/qualification/om2/sec/s3s4/rot-values-om1.om+seed/qualification/om2/sec/s3s4/lib-pu.om - file:seed/qualification/om2/oracle/s3s4/exp/rot-values.out - 0
# §3 l.79-81: n >= w traps 7 at run time (exit 107, nothing printed), constant and run-time n, n = w and n > w;
# A-D const n = w, E-H run-time n = w, I-L run-time n > w (w+1, type max), M-O const n > w, P control
rot-trap-A run seed/qualification/om2/sec/s3s4/rot-trap.om+seed/qualification/om2/sec/s3s4/lib-pu.om rep:65:1 file:seed/qualification/om2/oracle/s3s4/exp/rot-trap-A.out - 107
